MASC — Manifold-Aligned Semantic Clustering
ICML 2026

This repository is the official reference implementation accompanying the paper
"A Flat Vocabulary or a Rich Hierarchy? Re-introducing Intrinsic Structure
Transforms the Autoregressive Image Generation."

Scope of this release
----------------------
The repository provides the core MASC construction (the manifold-aligned
distance and the density-driven hierarchical clustering of Algorithm 1), the
coarse-target relabelling and decoding used to integrate the prior into an
autoregressive model, and diagnostics that let readers verify the method and its
reported behaviour. MASC is a plug-and-play module; the autoregressive backbones
it enhances are third-party works obtained from their official repositories and
are not redistributed here. See docs/reproduction.md.

